cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite the accompanying thesis and this repository."
type: software
title: "GIN and GCN for Spectral Radius Prediction"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ufrasi"
    given-names: "Giovanni"
abstract: >-
  A supervised comparison of Graph Isomorphism Networks and Graph
  Convolutional Networks for predicting adjacency spectral radius with
  constant node features, accompanying a BSc thesis at the University
  of Florence in academic year 2025/2026.
keywords:
  - graph neural networks
  - graph isomorphism network
  - graph convolutional network
  - spectral radius
  - graph regression
